# DMGAssist list: Discipline Priest damage between heals (learned from Method's guide, patch 12.1.5)
# Written by DMGAssist, not SimulationCraft. Healing and Atonement ramps stay the player's call: these are the
# damage casts that heal through Atonement. SimC's own list replaces this file if it ever publishes one.
actions.precombat=snapshot_stats
actions=shadowfiend
actions+=/mindbender
actions+=/shadow_word_pain,if=!dot.shadow_word_pain.ticking|dot.shadow_word_pain.refreshable
actions+=/shadow_word_death,if=target.health.pct<20
actions+=/mind_blast
actions+=/penance
actions+=/void_blast
actions+=/halo
actions+=/smite
